# Allowlist: main deploys only the asset CDN (vercel.mjs → tools/build-cdn.mjs → dist/), so Vercel
# receives just the files it serves (css/, js/, assets/) and the two files that build them.
# Everything else (pages, templates, cms/, docs, briefs, screenshots) stays in the repository.
/*
!/vercel.mjs
!/tools
/tools/*
!/tools/build-cdn.mjs
!/css
!/js
!/assets
